# Moddy Arena: a creature wished in prep. An Apprentice creature (a cat, a Builder make) made standing in the arena and
# aimed at its floor lands there; the same make made standing on the ground outside the place is refused by the reach
# rule, and nothing is left there. No model anywhere: the Apprentice's local matcher offers the make.
@intent in prep a player makes a creature with the Apprentice in the arena and it lands there; outside the place the same make is refused
@world flat seed=1
@continue-on-fail

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s

@step a creature aimed at the arena floor lands there
# he opens the gate in the shared wall and walks through it, into the arena
@aim pos 0.5 64.5 16.5
@key key.use
@wait 10t
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 45t
@wait 10t
@assert execute if entity @s[z=-15,dz=29]
@aim look 180 12
@wait 2s
# no battle is on and nothing else is in the arena: only what the wish makes will be there
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=!minecraft:player,tag=!moddyarena_panel,tag=!moddyarena_champions,x=-15,y=60,z=-15,dx=30,dy=12,dz=30]
moddy apprentice a cat
@expect screen Container within 10s
@shot apprentice-page
@click slot 0
@expect chat /is ready/ within 90s
@wait 3s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=!minecraft:player,tag=!moddyarena_panel,tag=!moddyarena_champions,x=-15,y=60,z=-15,dx=30,dy=12,dz=30]
@aim look 180 25
@wait 1s
@shot the-cat-in-the-arena

@step the same creature aimed outside the place is refused
# the flat world's ground, far below and away from the place, looking down at the grass in front of him
# SHORTCUT: he is put on the ground outside the place (getting out of it is not what the step tests)
tp @s 40 -60 0 90 0
@aim look 90 40
@wait 2s
@assert execute at @s if block ~ ~-1 ~ minecraft:grass_block
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=!minecraft:player,tag=!moddyarena_panel,tag=!moddyarena_champions,distance=..30]
moddy apprentice a cat
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /can't go there: a wish stays inside the arena and its prep room/ within 90s
@wait 3s
# nothing was left round him
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=!minecraft:player,tag=!moddyarena_panel,tag=!moddyarena_champions,distance=..30]
@shot refused-outside
